{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.SDP","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.PosSemidefTraceZero"],"declarations":26,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.PosSemidef.mul_zero_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.PosSemidef.mul_zero_comm","kind":"theorem","line":434,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L434-L462","doc":"**PSD multiplication commutes when product is zero** —\nproven from PSD ⟹ Hermitian ⟹ symmetric (real) +\ntranspose-of-product.\n\nFor PSD `S, Φ` with `S * Φ = 0`, taking transpose:\n`(S * Φ)ᵀ = Φᵀ * Sᵀ = Φ * S = 0ᵀ = 0`.\n\nNote (per Copilot review): the lemma name was originally\n`range_contained_in_kernel_of_mul_zero` based on the\nintuitive meaning (`Φ * S = 0` ⟺ `range(S) ⊆ ker(Φ)`),\nbut the Lean statement only encodes the commuted-\nmultiplication form.  Renamed to reflect what's actually\nproven; the range-inclusion interpretation is documented\nbut not stated as the theorem's type. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.real_strict_complementarity_optimum_subsingleton_via_class","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.real_strict_complementarity_optimum_subsingleton_via_class","kind":"theorem","line":388,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L388-L398","doc":"**Subsingleton wrapper** via the class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.real_strict_complementarity_unique_via_class","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.real_strict_complementarity_unique_via_class","kind":"theorem","line":366,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L366-L386","doc":"**General uniqueness via SDPSlaterUniqueness class**.\n\nRefactored version of `real_strict_complementarity_unique`\nusing the §3b conditional-class pattern.  Replaces the\nmulti-week kernel-uniqueness `sorry` with a typeclass\nrequirement.  Downstream theorems supply the class instance\nfrom the appropriate sub-case (interior, active-empty, or —\nwhen Mathlib SDP rank-deficiency lands — the general case).\n\nThis theorem is **fully proven** (no `sorry`); the\ncategorical content has been bookkeeping-shifted to the\n`SDPSlaterUniqueness` class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.ofActiveEmptyAndCostPosDef","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.ofActiveEmptyAndCostPosDef","kind":"def","line":354,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L354-L364","doc":"**Instance for the active-empty + cost-PosDef case** —\nderived from `_unique_of_active_empty_and_cost_posDef`\n(batch 26).  Fully proven. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.ofDualSlackPosDef","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.ofDualSlackPosDef","kind":"def","line":343,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L343-L352","doc":"**Instance for the interior case** (dual slack PosDef) —\nderived from `_unique_of_dualSlack_posDef` (batch 12).\nThis instance is **fully proven**, no axiom dependency. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.SDPSlaterUniqueness.unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.SDPSlaterUniqueness.unique","kind":"theorem","line":338,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L338-L338","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.SDPSlaterUniqueness.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.SDPSlaterUniqueness.mk","kind":"ctor","line":335,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L335-L335","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.SDPSlaterUniqueness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.SDPSlaterUniqueness","kind":"class","line":317,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L317-L341","doc":"**SDP Slater-Strict-Complementarity uniqueness** —\naxiomatised conditional-class.  An instance of this class\nasserts that, for the given primal SDP `sdp` and strict-\ncomplementarity certificate `sc`, the primal optimum\n`sc.Φstar` is unique among feasible matrices with matching\nobjective.  This is the categorical content of\nAlizadeh-Haeberly-Overton 1997 §3.\n\nPer §3b conditional-class pattern, this class is the\nLean-typed bookkeeping for the multi-week Mathlib SDP-\nrank-deficiency theorem; concrete instances supply the\nproof for specific cases. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.real_strict_complementarity_unique_of_active_empty_and_cost_posDef","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.real_strict_complementarity_unique_of_active_empty_and_cost_posDef","kind":"theorem","line":263,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L263-L296","doc":"**Uniqueness when the active set is empty + cost PosDef.**\n\nClosed proof via `_unique_of_dualSlack_posDef` after\nrewriting `dualSlack = cost`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.real_strict_complementarity_unique_of_dualSlack_posDef","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.real_strict_complementarity_unique_of_dualSlack_posDef","kind":"theorem","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L201-L245","doc":"**Interior-optimum uniqueness**: when the dual slack is\npositive-DEFINITE (not just PSD), uniqueness closes\ncompletely without the kernel-uniqueness sorry.\n\nPROOF: from `dualSlack_mul_feasible_eq_zero`,\n`S · Φ' = 0 = S · Φstar`.  Subtract: `S · (Φ' - Φstar) = 0`.\n`S` PosDef ⟹ `S` invertible.  Multiply both sides on the\nleft by `S⁻¹`: `Φ' - Φstar = 0`, i.e. `Φ' = Φstar`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.dualSlack_mul_feasible_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.dualSlack_mul_feasible_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L116-L127","doc":"**Dual-slack times feasible-optimum equals zero** —\ncomposition of `trace_dualSlack_eq_zero` with\n`complementary_slackness`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.trace_dualSlack_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.trace_dualSlack_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L98-L114","doc":"**Trace-zero from feasibility-and-optimum-match**.\n\nFor any feasible `Φ` with `objAt Φ = objAt Φstar`:\ntr(S(y*) · Φ) = objAt Φ - dualObjAt y*\n             = objAt Φstar - dualObjAt y*  (by h_obj)\n             = 0                          (by obj_eq_dualObj)\n","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.inactive_dual_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.inactive_dual_zero","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L96-L96","doc":"Off the active set, dual is exactly zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.active_dual_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.active_dual_pos","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L94-L94","doc":"On the active set, dual is strictly positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.active","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.active","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L92-L92","doc":"The active set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.mk","kind":"ctor","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L89-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.toRealStrongDualityPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair.toRealStrongDualityPair","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L89-L96","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrictComplementarityPair","kind":"structure","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L87-L96","doc":"**Real strict-complementarity pair** — extends\n`RealStrongDualityPair` with the active/inactive partition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDP.StrongDualityPair.toReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDP.StrongDualityPair.toReal","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L76-L85","doc":"At `R := ℝ` the generic `StrongDualityPair` carries exactly the\n`RealStrongDualityPair` fields (they agreed field-for-field once the\ngeneric `dual_feas` / `obj_eq` stopped being `True`, 2026-11-15). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.obj_eq_dualObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.obj_eq_dualObj","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L74-L74","doc":"**Strong-duality identity**: primal and dual objectives\ncoincide at the optimum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.dualSlack_psd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.dualSlack_psd","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L71-L71","doc":"**Dual feasibility**: dual slack is PSD. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.primal_feas","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.primal_feas","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L69-L69","doc":"Primal feasibility witness. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.ystar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.ystar","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L67-L67","doc":"Dual-optimal point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.Φstar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.Φstar","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L65-L65","doc":"Primal-optimal point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair.mk","kind":"ctor","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L63-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRealUniqueness.RealStrongDualityPair","kind":"structure","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean#L61-L74","doc":"**Real strong-duality pair** — `StrongDualityPair` upgraded\nwith concrete dual feasibility and strong-duality identity. ","signatureChunk":0}]}